        Topological shape transform for thymus structures
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+H">Haochen Yang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lebovici%2C+V">Vadim Lebovici</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tarcevski%2C+A">Andreas Tarcevski</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tchernev%2C+L">Liliana Tchernev</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zuklys%2C+S">Saulius Zuklys</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Holl%C3%A4nder%2C+G+A">Georg A. Holländer</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Byrne%2C+H+M">Helen M. Byrne</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Harrington%2C+H+A">Heather A. Harrington</a>
      
